2026-10-31T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2370) 'The layout and how a sheet is made
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2370  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2370) '&{repo("entities-sakuragaoka-station")}'s `tools/prop_shots.gd` is the precedent for that layout only (RFD66606-2283). A sheet is composed by rendering, with fragment shaders into a `SubViewport`, or in a godot-sandbox guest, never by a GDScript loop over pixels. Its script ships as `.sgd`, and its views come from `sphere_hammersley_sequence`.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2370  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2370) 'Sidecars and copies
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2370  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2370) 'Each sheet carries a `.cff` and its `<stem>.xmp` sidecar (RFD66606-2240). A copy goes to `lookdev-contact-sheets/` on the Desktop of the desk that made it, as `<topic>-NN.png`, the number rising so that no sheet is overwritten.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2370  1 LINE
 Text:Written

